@startuml 14_sequence_import_file
!include ../style.iuml
title Sequence diagram: importing a claim from a file (preview first, then submit)
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 230

actor "Administrator\n(level 4)" as AD
participant "Console" as UI
participant "Reviewer API\n(POST /queue/import/file)" as API
participant "Gate\n(cg-ingest)" as GT
participant "Reader container\n(no network)" as RD
participant "Extractor\n(draft claim)" as EX
participant "Security\nlog" as LOG
participant "Intake\n(POST /queue/submit)" as IN

AD -> UI : choose a file
UI -> API : raw bytes + file name\n(cookie, CSRF, permission routing.manage)
API -> GT : inspect(bytes)\n(type read from the bytes, size, pixel cap,\nactive content, polyglot checks)
alt refused by the gate
  GT --> API : refusal code and reason
  API -> LOG : import refused
  API --> UI : 422 refused
else not a PDF, PNG or JPEG
  GT --> API : unsupported type
  API -> API : read as JSON, JSONL or FHIR bundles\n(each record accepted or quarantined with its reason;\nat most 500 records)
  API -> LOG : import records (hash, size, outcome)
  API --> UI : items and summary
else a document (PDF, PNG, JPEG)
  alt no reader configured or reader down
    API --> UI : 503 (nothing is guessed)
  else two documents are already being read
    API --> UI : 429 busy
  else reader available
    API -> RD : bytes and type (shared token)
    RD -> RD : refuse JavaScript, launch actions,\nembedded files, encryption;\nPDF text layer, or Tesseract\n(+ optional vision model as second reader)
    RD --> API : pages, text, confidence, second reading
    API -> EX : extract(pages, hash, catalogue)
    EX --> API : draft claim: value, evidence and\nconfidence of every field, warnings
    API -> LOG : import document (hash, engine, draft valid?)
    API --> UI : draft shown beside the page
  end
end

== A person confirms: the system never decides on a converted claim ==
AD -> UI : compare the page with the draft,\ncorrect the fields
UI -> API : POST /queue/import/validate (edited claim)
API --> UI : valid, or the reason\n(same transport check as intake)
AD -> UI : confirm and submit
UI -> API : POST /queue/submit
API -> IN : validate again, check the 15 rules,\ntriage, store (see the processing sequence)
IN --> UI : job id, then the triage receipts (polling)

note over RD
  The server never parses a PDF or decodes a picture:
  only the reader does, in its own container.
end note
@enduml
